# --- Browser artefacts from tools/ ----------------------------------------
# tools/shots.mjs and tools/console-check.mjs each drive a headless Edge, and
# Edge writes a full browser profile wherever it is pointed: caches, LevelDB
# shards, Crashpad dumps. 839 files and 70MB of it were committed, which is
# most of why .git is 48MB and why `git status` was unreadable - every
# screenshot run churned another ~200 binary files.
#
# Both directories are rebuilt from nothing on the next run.
/.pdf-profile
/storage/.shot-profile

# Screenshots are build output, not source: 22 binaries that change on every
# run and cannot be reviewed in a diff. Regenerate with:
#   node tools/shots.mjs <email>
/storage/shots
